      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "随机武器与升级迫使每局临场适应",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Each run is unique and you never know what upgrades or weapons you will get as drops from monsters and for completing stages. Adapt and strategize to playthroughs that are never the same.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2406370/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "职业各有独立天赋树，每关只可三选一升级",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Unlock new classes as you progress, each with its unique talent trees and game-changing effects. Choose carefully, as you can only pick one upgrade each stage from a selection of 3 randomly presented options.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2406370/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
